find [SimTalk] - array
Searches for a value in the one-dimensional array designated by <array>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<array>.find(Value:any[, StartIndex:integer])
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The parameter Value of data type any designates the value that you want to find.
• The optional parameter StartIndex of data type integer sets the start index, i.e., the position, from which
on Plant Simulation starts a search toward the end of the array.
Return Value
