Date [SimTalk] - data type
A local variable of data type date designates a date between 01.01.1900 and 31.12.9999.
Remarks
When assigning a value to a variable or an attribute of the data type time, you have to convert the date
with the function str_to_date.
Before you assign a value to the local variable, it has an initial value. It is 0 for all numerical data types,
false for the data type boolean, an empty string ("") for the data type string, and void for the data types
object and list or table.
The initial value for the data types date and DateTime depends on the Plant Simulation version in which
you initially created your simulation model. For models, which you created in Plant Simulation 14.0 or
higher, the start value is 01.01.1900.
